OL,3,GNEWSAPrison Service opposed release of
OL,4,Amurderer who absconded - Long
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Northern Ireland Prison Service
OL,7,Fobjected to a convicted murderer being
OL,8,Freleased from prison to attend his
OL,9,Ffather's funeral, before a court
OL,10,Fordered his temporary release, Justice
OL,11,FMinister Naomi Long has revealed.
OL,13,FGary Anderson, 29, is one of two
OL,14,Fbrothers jailed for life in 2023 for
OL,15,Fthe murder of Karol Kelly in
OL,16,FLondonderry in 2018.
OL,18,FAnderson was released from Maghaberry
OL,19,FPrison on Monday to attend the funeral,
OL,20,Fbut absconded from his court-approved
OL,21,Fchaperone, the justice minister told
OL,22,Fthe Assembly.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,415,410,260,120,0,100
