OL,3,GNEWSAPrison Service opposed release of
OL,4,Amurderer who absconded - Long
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong said Anderson's release followed
OL,7,Fan urgent judicial review after the
OL,8,FPrison Service refused Anderson's
OL,9,Fapplication for compassionate temporary
OL,10,Frelease following a risk assessment.
